<title>UK: Barr in talks to sell leisure division.</title>
<headline>Barr in talks to sell leisure division.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barr &amp; Wallace Arnold Trusts Plc said on Tuesday that is in talks about the possible sale of its lesiure division. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>By 1049 GMT, shares in the company had risen 18p to stand at 256-1/2.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom + 44 171 542 4019</p>
